    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8c/Cygnus_qbul.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230111021447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Cygnus qbul\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"438\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cygnus qbul.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Cygnus_qbul.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8c/Cygnus_qbul.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230111021447\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eSwan of Archery [白鳥の射手,\u003c/b\u003e Hakuchō no ite\u003cb\u003e]\u003c/b\u003e\nA woman as lovely as a white swan who looses arrows with precision and grace. One shot from her could dive into the water with such silence as to not even cause a ripple, nor rouse any prey.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"bc78ece7c0f4be597efbcce4414174bf\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Cygnus_Swan_of_Archery_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:110px; top:0.5px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Cygnus_Swan_of_Archery_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg\" title=\"Cyg